From: Nerves KickPi K2B <nerves@kickpi-k2b>
Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: advertise PSCI 1.0 in the control DTB for SMCCC TRNG

U-Boot's SMCCC feature discovery binds the SMCCC TRNG (kaslrseed seed
source) only when the PSCI node is compatible with arm,psci-1.0; the
H616/H618 dtsi declares only arm,psci-0.2. The firmware is PSCI 1.1.
---
diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/sun50i-h618-kickpi-k2b-u-boot.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/sun50i-h618-kickpi-k2b-u-boot.dtsi
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1c94d8a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/sun50i-h618-kickpi-k2b-u-boot.dtsi
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
+/*
+ * U-Boot control-DTB fixups for the KickPi K2B.
+ *
+ * This file shadows the SoC-family sunxi-u-boot.dtsi that boards
+ * otherwise pick up via CONFIG_SYS_SOC, so it must include it to keep the
+ * sunxi SPL FIT description.
+ */
+#include "sunxi-u-boot.dtsi"
+
+/*
+ * The H616/H618 PSCI node declares only "arm,psci-0.2", but U-Boot's SMCCC
+ * feature discovery in drivers/firmware/psci.c gates on "arm,psci-1.0"
+ * (device_is_compatible), and that discovery is what binds the SMCCC
+ * TRNG driver used to seed KASLR. The firmware is PSCI 1.1, so advertise
+ * 1.0 here for the U-Boot control DTB; without it kaslrseed reports
+ * "No RNG device" even though BL31's TRNG works.
+ */
+&{/psci} {
+	compatible = "arm,psci-1.0", "arm,psci-0.2";
+};
